Gridi
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 3 DEAL COLUMN
COLUMN 5 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 5 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 10 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 0 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 2 FACE_HALF

NAIZUS 3 FACE_HALF
NAIZUS 4 FACE_HALF
NAIZUS 10 FACE_HALF
NAIZUS 10 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE NAIZUS NAIZUS
DEST Rank K
MOVE_STACK NAIZUS NAIZUS
AND
    DESTSRC Rank equal
    OR
        DESTSRC Suit match
        SRC Rank K
DRAW
PILE ANY DRAW Size > 0
$win
AND
    PILE ALL NAIZUS Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL NAIZUS Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
